## Appendix — Common ZIP-to-Hydra Token Mappings

Use this table as a starting point. Always verify against the actual token values in the repo.

| Common ZIP pattern | Hydra equivalent |
|-------------------|-----------------|
| Primary brand blue | `token.colorPrimary` |
| Primary background tint | `token.colorPrimaryBg` |
| Primary border | `token.colorPrimaryBorder` |
| Orange / volcano accent | `primaryPrimitiveOrange.volcanoStep[N]` |
| Default text | `token.colorText` |
| Secondary text | `token.colorTextSecondary` |
| Disabled text | `token.colorTextDisabled` |
| Container background | `token.colorBgContainer` |
| Subtle fill / alt bg | `token.colorFillAlter` |
| Border (default) | `token.colorBorder` |
| Border (secondary) | `token.colorBorderSecondary` |
| Success green | `token.colorSuccess` |
| Error red | `token.colorError` |
| Warning orange | `token.colorWarning` |
| Base spacing unit | `token.padding` (16 px) |
| Small spacing | `token.paddingSM` (12 px) |
| Extra-small spacing | `token.paddingXS` (8 px) |
| Large spacing | `token.paddingLG` (24 px) |
| Base border radius | `token.borderRadius` |
| Large border radius | `token.borderRadiusLG` |
| Header height | `shellLayout.headerHeight` |
| Sidebar / sider width | `shellLayout.siderWidth` |
